# Libraries below are disabled because M5StampFly does not have the matching
# hardware, or the feature is not useful for this small indoor MAVLink-controlled
# aircraft. Keep generally useful disable guards upstreamable, and keep
# M5StampFly-specific choices in this hwdef.
